leared together): 0 years 13 months becomes 1 year 1 month, 13 months in total.",[345,349,350],{},"The three bindings can be used alone or together. When the parent fills in total months and years\u002Fmonths that conflict, total months win; when only years\u002Fmonths are filled in, they are summed again and carried over.",[345,352,353,354,357,358,361],{},"An empty side counts as 0; when both are empty, all three bindings are ",[299,355,356],{},"null",". Strings, negative numbers, decimals, ",[299,359,360],{},"NaN"," or values beyond the safe integer range from the parent count as empty.",[323,363,365],{"id":364},"narrow-containers","Narrow containers",[296,367,368],{},"When the container is too narrow for both the years and months inputs, it switches to a single \"total months\" input; with enough width it goes back to both inputs, keeping any input not yet committed.",[338,370],{"name":371},"months-compact",[323,373,375],{"id":374},"variants","Variants",[296,377,378,379,306,382,385,386,389],{},"Uses the ",[299,380,381],{},"color",[299,383,384],{},"highlight"," of ",[299,387,388],{},"UInput",", applied to every input.",[338,391],{"name":392},"months-color",[323,394,396],{"id":395},"size-and-states","Size and states",[296,398,399,400,403],{},"While loading, a spinner shows after the months unit and input is disabled. The year and month units switch with the locale (\"yr\" and \"mo\" in English, \"年\" and \"月\" in Traditional Chinese); their width follows the text, and so does the width needed for the full years and months layout. See ",[312,401,102],{"href":402},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Foverview\u002Fcommon"," for the behavior shared by all states.",[338,405],{"name":406},"months-states",[318,408,410],{"id":409},"examples","Examples",[323,412,414],{"id":413},"with-form-validation","With form validation",[296,416,417,418,421,422,306,425,428],{},"Bind the total months, use ",[299,419,420],{},"requiredNumber"," for a required field, and check bounds separately with ",[2